{"sourceUrl":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/info/1173/17334.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:09.951550+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/info/1173/17334.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>根据教育部相关文件精神和学校《</span>2026<span>年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法》（校研发〔</span>2025<span>〕</span>30<span>号）文件要求，现将人文学院<span>2026</span><span>年</span>接收推免研究生复试工作有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、接收专业及录取名额</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><strong><span>接收名额</span></strong></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>055101</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>英语笔译</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>4</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>045300</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>国际中文教育</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>3</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span>二、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>取得本科就读高校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.<span>具有过硬的政治素质，社会责任感强，诚实守信，品行优良，</span></span><span>积极向上，身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>具有较强的创新意识和创新能力，恪守学术道德规范。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、工作程序</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>1.</strong><strong><span>线上报名</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong> 9</strong><strong><span>月</span>19</strong><strong><span>日中午</span>12</strong><strong><span>：</span>00</strong><strong><span>前</span></strong><span>，申请人通过以下链接</span><span><span></span><a href=\"https://f.wps.cn/g/ZUrvuetw/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://f.wps.cn/g/ZUrvuetw/</a> <span>提交报名信息和相关材料。提交材料内容：接收推免报名表（附件</span>1<span>）、由本科在读高校开具的推免资格及排名证明<span>（附件</span><span>2</span><span>）</span>、思想品德考核表（附件</span>3<span>）、本科阶段成绩单（加盖教务部门公章）、专业相关的竞赛和学术成果等。同时，以“专业代码</span>-<span>姓名”的实名方式加入</span>QQ<span>群</span><span>：</span>801538787<span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>2.</strong><strong><span>复试安排</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span>学院将根据申请情况择时进行筛选，择优确定复试名单并发出复试通知（具体安排以学院后续通知为准）。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>3.</strong><strong><span>正式报名</span> </strong></span></p>\n<p><span>通过预报名且复试合格、同时获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格者，应在我校规定时间内按要求履行网上报名、复试确认、拟录取确认等相关手续。</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>4.</strong><strong><span>推免服务系统操作</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人须在</span>9<span>月</span>22<span>日起登录推免服务系统进行注册，推免服务系统开放后可填报志愿。学院也将通过推免服务系统发出复试通知、待录取通知，请申请人务必注意查收。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>四、其他事项</span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>其他事项</span><span>按照《</span>2026<span>年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法》（校研发〔</span>2025<span>〕</span>30<span>号）<span>（附件4）</span>及《四川农业大学</span>2026<span>年接收推免研究生（含直博生）工作的通知》</span>https://yan.sicau.edu.cn/info/1025/11736.htm<span>相关要求执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>复试相关事项可咨询人文学院刘老师，电话：</span>0835-2882256<span>，地点：文法楼</span>203<span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>本次接收推免生复试工作接受纪委全程监督，纪检监察联系人：陈老师，电话：</span>0835-2882394<span>，邮箱：</span><span>junlinchen@sicau.edu.cn</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本通知由人文学院负责解释。其他未尽事宜按照教育部要求和学校关于</span>2026<span>年接收推免生工作有关规定执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>人文学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2025<span>年</span>9<span>月</span>16<span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"339889b2aa339caaa782d1f9053564a159bd3cde0c6b8d050c25934fb656e8ce","textLength":955,"sourceSha256":"ac5efd4f9aa4cb5f11fbc8de8e854602406e9ab1575ab1143a3fc19e3ef25ea9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 四川农业大学人文学院2026年接收推免研究生报名表.doc","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=46E281C5466F4A67DAE2B85CF7BAF9B0"},{"name":"附件3 四川农业大学人文学院接收推免生思想品德考核表.doc","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=D00C8ECD4EA047DA7CBEB507A4D58798"},{"name":"附件2 四川农业大学人文学院学生推免成绩排名及资格证明模板.docx","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=D68F2D38F520E939E234E68BE37232CD"},{"name":"附件4 2026年招收推免研究生复试、录取工作办法（校研发〔2025〕30 号）.pdf","url":"https://rwy.sicau.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1594223836&wbfileid=7E4CE6AB7BE7B5CC0E7BF0F828D67993"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6a611f9328c668191d71","title":"2025年四川农业大学人文学院2026年接收推免研究生复试工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:09.951550+00:00"}
